        "Content": "<ul><li> Three-bedroom mid-terrace house</li><li> Private front garden with lawn and driveway</li><li> Rear garden with lawned area</li><li> Useful under-stairs storage</li><li> Well-proportioned accommodation throughout</li><li> Mature and established residential location</li><li> Convenient location close to a wide range of local amenities</li><li> Excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas</ul>"
